  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Chainlink -- the industry-standard decentralised oracle network providing tamper-proof data feeds, verifiable randomness (VRF), and Cross-Chain Interoperability Protocol (CCIP). Enables OASIS holons and contracts to consume real-world data and communicate cross-chain. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
